{"uid":"8f4195fd0e22a07a","name":"test_a_corroborated_claim_resets_the_stagnation_counter_mid_streak","fullName":"tests.test_progress_pin_task015#test_a_corroborated_claim_resets_the_stagnation_counter_mid_streak","historyId":"203d899d6fc1310a7b0df5992792045c","time":{"start":1791925967308,"stop":1791925967434,"duration":126},"description":"Five iterations on one task, no other witness available (no real\n    commits, no tasks.json edit, no tool activity): iterations 1 and 2\n    claim `commit` evidence with NO tree delta (uncorroborated, advancing\n    the counter to 2 -- one short of the guard); iteration 3 claims `file`\n    evidence WITH a real tree delta (corroborated, and this is the fact\n    under test: it must reset the counter to 0, not merely fail to add to\n    it); iterations 4 and 5 repeat the uncorroborated pair. Without the\n    reset, the running total across these five passes (2 before + 1 for\n    the corroborated pass itself if it did not reset + 2 after) would trip\n    the guard on the third or fifth pass; with it, it never does.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Five iterations on one task, no other witness available (no real<br />\ncommits, no tasks.json edit, no tool activity): iterations 1 and 2<br />\nclaim <code>commit</code> evidence with NO tree delta (uncorroborated, advancing<br />\nthe counter to 2 -- one short of the guard); iteration 3 claims <code>file</code><br />\nevidence WITH a real tree delta (corroborated, and this is the fact<br />\nunder test: it must reset the counter to 0, not merely fail to add to<br />\nit); iterations 4 and 5 repeat the uncorroborated pair. Without the<br />\nreset, the running total across these five passes (2 before + 1 for<br />\nthe corroborated pass itself if it did not reset + 2 after) would trip<br />\nthe guard on the third or fifth pass; with it, it never does.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"befor